WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.661
Today is the first move. Touch every letter.

2
00:00:03.111 --> 00:00:09.923
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:10.423 --> 00:00:13.002
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

4
00:00:13.502 --> 00:00:16.741
Every word on today's page has a dot under each letter.

5
00:00:17.191 --> 00:00:23.284
Put a finger on the first dot. Say the sound. Move to the next dot. Then slide, and say the word.

6
00:00:26.983 --> 00:00:27.921
The word is sun.

7
00:00:28.821 --> 00:00:30.024
Here is another one.

8
00:00:32.967 --> 00:00:34.042
The word is jet.

9
00:00:34.942 --> 00:00:38.735
The finger starts on the left, every time. It does not skip a letter.

10
00:00:39.185 --> 00:00:44.760
You do the first two words. Then your child does the rest of job one, with a finger on each dot.

11
00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:49.382
If a guess comes, do not say the word. Say: look again. Touch every letter.

12
00:00:49.832 --> 00:00:55.538
Job two is for your child alone. Read each word first. Then draw a line to its picture.

13
00:00:55.988 --> 00:01:00.328
The picture comes after the word. So the picture is the check, and not the clue.

14
00:01:00.778 --> 00:01:04.241
At the end, your child reads three words to you. Mark each one.
